      "content": "Your existence matters not because of your presence, but because your actions ripple outward to everyone you push or pull aside. That \"ghostlike\" feeling is simply the system not missing a single piece, just as a city's grid remains intact whether a car is there or not. Don't mistake the lack of noticed weight for a lack of value; even the smallest signal travels faster and further than its creator imagines.",
